      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The industry trend is moving towards focusing on *impact* over *intent* when moderating content. Guidelines generally distinguish satire when it aims to critique systems or ideas versus when it attacks protected groups or individuals with dehumanizing or inciting language. The critical line is typically drawn when speech crosses from hyperbolic commentary into targeted threats, slurs, or calls for violence against protected characteristics.",
